From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:17:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] cheats/ios: add offline trampolines, VM-driven conditional
 slots, and memory scanner

Add a 16 KB writable cheat_state_page (4,096 single-byte slots + 12 KB Code Cave mirror), offline AArch64 NZCV-preserving trampoline baking and Code Cave switch-table relocation (dm/tools/cheat_bake.py wired into patch_nso.py, build_ipa_from_nsp.py, and build_ipa.sh), runtime VM-driven conditional trampoline dispatch for Opcode 8/C4/1/C0 code cheats on unjailbroken iOS, Zing 20000000/20000001 group markers, Mac memcmp deduplication with automatic original_code restoration on disable, and a safe data-only memory value scanner API.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Enable zero-JIT static and conditional code cheats on iOS via 16 KB cheat_state_page trampolines, Zing sections, Mac original_code restore, and a safe data memory scanner
Issue: none
---
